      "key": {
        "uuid": "2250e6f7_6b4a0423",
        "filename": "resources/com/google/gitiles/static/base.css",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 24,
      "author": {
        "id": 1030207
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T23:36:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": ":root, html[data-theme\u003d\"light\"] currently sets color-scheme: light dark;, while html[data-theme\u003d\"dark\"] does not specify color-scheme.\n\nWhen data-theme\u003d\"light\" is active while the user\u0027s OS is in dark mode, color-scheme: light dark; allows the browser to render form controls, scrollbars, and system canvases in dark mode against the light page background. Conversely, html[data-theme\u003d\"dark\"] lacks color-scheme: dark; to ensure system scrollbars and controls switch to dark mode on light OS themes.\n\nConsider splitting this so:\n- :root uses color-scheme: light dark;\n- html[data-theme\u003d\"light\"] uses color-scheme: light;\n- html[data-theme\u003d\"dark\"] and @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root { color-scheme: dark; } } use color-scheme: dark;",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "61a2ed91c00c5bf0023065c88aa03ebb4882bd44",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
