      "side": 1,
      "message": "Consider using icon.textContent \u003d \u0027☾\u0027 (or \\u263E / \\u2600 / \\u25D1) instead of icon.innerHTML \u003d \u0027\u0026#9789;\u0027.\n\ntextContent avoids invoking the browser\u0027s HTML parser for single character entities and avoids tripping Trusted Types or innerHTML linters.",
      "isAi": true,
