      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T23:36:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In Common.soy, the toggle button defines aria-label\u003d\"Toggle theme\". In updateButton, btn.title and label.textContent are updated when the theme changes, but aria-label remains static.\n\nConsider updating btn.setAttribute(\u0027aria-label\u0027, btn.title) (or removing the static aria-label so screen readers announce the dynamic text label) so assistive technologies accurately announce the current theme and intended action.",
