      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T23:36:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since Renderer.java injects csp_nonce into template injected parameters (ij) when a CSP nonce is present on the request, these inline \u003cscript\u003e tags in themeScript and themeToggle should include nonce\u003d\"{$csp_nonce}\" (e.g. {@inject? csp_nonce: string} and \u003cscript{if $csp_nonce} nonce\u003d\"{$csp_nonce}\"{/if}\u003e...). Without the nonce attribute, deployments enforcing Content-Security-Policy with script nonces will block execution of the theme initialization and toggle scripts.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "61a2ed91c00c5bf0023065c88aa03ebb4882bd44",
